        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-17T10:32:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, interesting - the current board thing does take up a lot of space, that's true. With yours, though, where do earned/discarded Fear cards go (also discarded Event cards)? Just in piles next to it? I think I'd like if it had pockets for everything (it looks like the Fear pool is just next to the box as well), so it can all be in tidy little places :D. But then, you're making this for you, not for me, so that doesn't really matter. It's a nice idea, anyway :).</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
