        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-17T13:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah the discards are just sort of... \"hide it&nbsp;behind the standing cards\".<br>\nI think I'll eventually make somewhere for the earned fear cards and fear to 'land', along with labeling some of the zones.&nbsp;But I can't&nbsp;just make it bigger since I also am trying to fit an exact slot I have in the game-box.</p>\n<p>[That's why the island card has its little kickstand]</p>\n<p>The feedback is helpful though, this is still just me trying stuff, maybe I could add some cardstock foldouts for discards behind, earned fear/fearcards to the right.</p>",
